# Commands Practiced

Check backend application status:

```bash
sudo systemctl status myapp
```

Check Nginx status:

```bash
sudo systemctl status nginx
```

View system logs:

```bash
sudo journalctl -xe
```

View Nginx error logs:

```bash
sudo tail -20 /var/log/nginx/error.log
```

Check listening ports:

```bash
sudo ss -tuln
```

List running processes:

```bash
ps aux
```

